---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Panorama from '../components/Panorama.astro';
import { apps } from '../apps';
---

<Base title="About — Intelios">
  <Panorama title="About" accent="#0078d7">
    <section class="pano-section">
      <h2 class="pano-section-label">Intelios</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          Hi, I'm Intelios or Jack (my friends call me Wack and I'm not sure that's a good
          thing but I run with it, as you can probably tell). I'm from Scotland and I do
          this for fun just making apps I personally want to use in my life, I don't make
          them with the intention of making money I just make apps where I'm like I can't
          see anything like this online or does it the way I want it to, so then I go and
          make it. This is a page I've made to have my applications in a somewhat central
          place. I work on various things and I only put something on this site if I truly
          believe it's worth using, I hope you'll agree on that one but I don't upload
          prototypes or projects I have no intention of finishing. Hope you find at least
          one thing on this page you like :)
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="pano-section">
      <h2 class="pano-section-label">Apps</h2>
      <ul class="app-list">
        {apps.map((app) => (
          <li>
            <a href={`/apps/${app.slug}`} style={`color:${app.pageAccent ?? app.color}`}>
              <span class="swatch" style={`background:${app.color}`} />{app.name}
            </a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section class="pano-section">
      <h2 class="pano-section-label">Elsewhere</h2>
      <ul class="app-list">
        <li>
          <a class="release-link" href="https://github.com/Intelios" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            github.com/Intelios →
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </Panorama>
</Base>
